WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
The result. A real app renders aircraft cards from a natural-language request.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.829
Define the contract. Component props use Skillet schemas; the app owns the implementation.

00:00:07.829 --> 00:00:18.198
Ask in plain words. The scripted response passes through Hashbrown and renders the registered cards.

00:00:18.198 --> 00:00:23.634
Wire up the UI. The Angular and React implementations create UI chat with their native APIs.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:29.034
Inspect the result. The completed cards display aircraft data returned by the app tools.
